    "title": "BYU 1-on-1: Is it all good news coming out of spring football? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Darnell Dickson Brandon C. Gurney - ,\n1 days ago Daily Herald sports writers Darnell Dickson and Brandon Gurney debate and pontificate on the hot BYU sports topics of the week. 1. It’s spring football, which generally means it’s all unicorns and rainbows for the BYU football program with a spot in the CFP and even a national championship guaranteed. Okay, but seriously, what’s the best news you’ve heard coming out of BYU’s spring practice session? Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
